  "description": "After enduring a hellish two-hour commute to school each way, Kyung-woo finally gets his wish of living alone! However, his joy is short-lived, as his classmate offers to double his investment, and he ends up skipping all of his moving expenses. Out of pity, one of his seniors introduces him to a friend who lives alone in a large house, and Kyung-woo takes up residence there.\n\nThe owner of the house, Tae-hee, is very happy to accept Kyung-woo for the first time, and Kyung-woo is moved by this, but it seems that he and Tae-hee have a past that he had forgotten about...? \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4419052), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297061873), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000058965), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230718), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/inallcircu), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/under_gyeongu), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62645412)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/HEALING/beishuaigeshouliuderizi/list?title_no=1524), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/165641)",
